[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":151},"routes/content-page",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"page",{"_15":41,"_21":22,"_42":7,"_17":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_19":50,"_51":52,"_9":53},"related",[11,12,13,14],{"_15":36,"_17":37,"_19":38,"_21":22},{"_15":31,"_17":32,"_19":33,"_21":22},{"_15":26,"_17":27,"_19":28,"_21":22},{"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22},"slug","contact-us","title","Contact us","seo",{"_17":23,"_24":25},"area","company","Contact us: 24/7 support | holidayfinder","description","Reach holidayfinder’s travel experts 24/7 by WhatsApp, phone or email. Help before you book, during your trip and after you’re home.","campaigns","Campaigns and offers",{"_17":29,"_24":30},"Campaigns and offers | holidayfinder","Current holidayfinder campaigns and offers: flexible payment plans, seasonal deals and ways to save on holidays, flights, stays and experiences.","work-with-us","Work with us",{"_17":34,"_24":35},"Work with us | holidayfinder","Careers at holidayfinder: how we work, our teams, our hiring process and speculative applications. Hotels and local experiences can partner with us.","about-us","About us",{"_17":39,"_24":40},"About us | holidayfinder","Who we are, what we sell, how we choose hotels and partners, and the promises we make to everyone who books a trip with holidayfinder.","affiliate-programme","kind","Affiliate programme","lead","Earn a commission when your readers and followers book holidays and stays with holidayfinder.","published","2026-04-14","updated","2026-10-22",{"_17":149,"_24":150},"sections",[54,55,56,57,58,59,60],[36,31,26,16],{"_61":139,"_17":140,"_102":141,"_64":142},{"_61":127,"_17":128,"_64":129},{"_61":121,"_17":122,"_102":123,"_64":124},{"_61":112,"_17":113,"_64":114},{"_61":100,"_17":101,"_102":103,"_64":104},{"_61":93,"_17":94,"_64":95},{"_61":62,"_17":63,"_64":65},"id","questions","Questions about the programme","blocks",[66],{"_67":68,"_69":70},"type","faq","items",[71,72,73,74,75],{"_76":90,"_78":91},{"_76":87,"_78":88},{"_76":84,"_78":85},{"_76":81,"_78":82},{"_76":77,"_78":79},"question","Can I link to a specific hotel or destination?","answer",[80],"Yes. You can create a tracking link to any page of the store, including offers, searches and [destination guides](/destinations).","What happens if a booking is cancelled?",[83],"Commission is only paid on completed trips, so cancelled bookings don't earn commission.","When do I get paid?",[86],"Commission is confirmed once the trip has been completed and is paid monthly, as set out in the programme terms.","Is there a minimum audience size?",[89],"No fixed minimum. We look at how relevant your audience is to travel and the quality of your content.","Does it cost anything to join?",[92],"No. Joining the affiliate programme is free.","apply","How to apply",[96],{"_67":97,"_98":99},"paragraph","text","Email [partners@holidayfinder.example](mailto:partners@holidayfinder.example) with a link to your site or channels, the size of your audience and where they are based. We'll reply with next steps.","rules","Programme rules","intro","A few rules keep the programme fair for everyone.",[105],{"_67":106,"_69":107},"list",[108,109,110,111],"No bidding on the holidayfinder brand name in search ads.","Always tell your audience that you earn a commission, as advertising rules require.","No misleading prices or claims: show prices as the store shows them.","No sending spam or buying traffic from sites we haven't approved.","tools","Tools for affiliates",[115],{"_67":106,"_69":116},[117,118,119,120],"**Tracking links** to any search, offer or page of the store.","**Deep links to our [destination guides](/destinations)**, ready to recommend in your own travel content.","**A deals feed** with current prices and campaigns, refreshed every day.","**Banners and photos** you are allowed to use, in the sizes you need.","earnings","What you earn","A commission on completed stays and holidays; rates are in the programme terms.",[125],{"_67":97,"_98":126},"Commission is paid on the value of bookings that are completed, not cancelled. Rates depend on the type of booking and are set out in the programme terms you accept when you join.","how-it-works","How it works",[130],{"_67":106,"_131":132,"_69":133},"ordered",true,[134,135,136,137,138],"Apply to join. We review every application, usually within a few working days.","Once approved, create tracking links to any page of the store.","Share them in your articles, videos, posts or newsletters.","When someone books through your link and completes their trip, you earn a commission.","See clicks, bookings and earnings in your dashboard, and get paid every month.","who-its-for","Who it's for","Anyone who inspires people to travel and wants to recommend a store they trust.",[143],{"_67":106,"_69":144},[145,146,147,148],"Travel bloggers and writers","Creators on Instagram, TikTok and YouTube","Publishers, newsletters and comparison sites","Communities and clubs that plan trips together","Affiliate programme | holidayfinder","Join the holidayfinder affiliate programme: links, destination guide deep links and a deals feed for travel bloggers, creators and publishers.",{"_152":153},"store",{"_61":154,"_155":154,"_156":157,"_158":159,"_160":161,"_162":163,"_164":165,"_19":166,"_167":168,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180},"holidayfinder","name","currency","EUR","site",{"_939":940,"_941":942},"engine",{"_935":936,"_937":938},"footer",{"_753":851,"_852":853,"_222":854,"_855":856,"_857":858,"_171":859,"_860":861},"theme",{"_796":797,"_798":799,"_800":801,"_802":803,"_804":805,"_806":807,"_808":809},{"_787":788,"_24":789,"_790":791},"menu",{"_753":754},"preferences",{"_705":706,"_707":708,"_709":710,"_711":157},"legal",{"_703":704,"_218":219},"home",{"_203":204,"_205":206,"_207":208,"_209":210,"_211":212,"_213":214},"support",{"_193":194,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":200},"paymentMethods",[189,190,191,192],"announcement",{"_181":182,"_183":184},"message",